## ✅ Optimized Fibonacci (Just for comparison)

```java
static int fib(int n, int[] dp) {
    if (n <= 1) return n;
    if (dp[n] != 0) return dp[n];

    dp[n] = fib(n-1, dp) + fib(n-2, dp);
    return dp[n];
}
```

⏱ Time → **O(n)**  
📦 Space → **O(n)**

